  "notes": [
    "upgradeToAndCall selected implementation 0x13dde273, which introduced openV6/redeemPosition (absent from the previous implementation's bytecode); the only later admin change (setPair, slot 5) is not read by the exploit. Implementation and distributor sources are unverified; the defect is attributed from traces.",
    "Distributor SEA has no market price, so it is valued at what the attackers realised (rule 12): USDT net-drained from the SEA/USDT pair in the 16 redemption txs and the 36 later disposal txs by 0xee1f058c in refs, plus the unsold SEA residual at post-campaign pair spot. Flash-loan premiums are not deducted."
